      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ロイヤルアベニューの　かだんで\nてにいれた　はなのミツ。　とくていの\nポケモンの　すがたを　かえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "로열 애버뉴 화단에서 손에 넣은\n꽃의 꿀. 특정 포켓몬의\n모습을 바꾼다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在皇家大道的花壇裡獲得的花蜜。\n可以改變特定寶可夢的樣子。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un nectar obtenu à partir des fleurs de la Rue\ndu Dôme Royal. Permet à un certain Pokémon\nde changer d’apparence.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Blütennektar von der Blumeninsel nahe der Avenue\nRoyale. Ein bestimmtes Pokémon kann damit seine\nForm ändern.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Néctar de ciertas flores de los parterres de la\nAvenida Royale, capaz de hacer cambiar de forma\na una determinada especie de Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Nettare ottenuto dai fiori delle aiuole di Viale\nRoyale. Fa cambiare forma a una determinata\nspecie di Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The flower nectar obtained at the flowering shrubs\non Royal Avenue.\nIt changes the form of certain species of Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
